lede: The M5 runs about 160 miles from the M6 at West Bromwich, past Birmingham, Worcester, Gloucester and Bristol, down to Exeter. It's the main road to the South West, so it's busiest in the summer. Wherever you've stopped on it, call us with the nearest junction and we'll send a local recovery operator to you.
